WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.037
One radar, many sources: job boards,
company career pages, Google Jobs,

2
00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:06.680
even your alert emails.

3
00:00:07.755 --> 00:00:09.227
Each runs on its own.

4
00:00:09.227 --> 00:00:12.295
When one breaks, it pauses
itself and the rest keep going.

5
00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:15.245
Paid sources get a monthly budget.
